<title>USA: Southwest Airlines issues $100 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Southwest Airlines issues $100 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Southwest Airlines Co was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>BORROWER SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 7.375 PCT  MATURITY 3/1/2027</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.639  FIRST PAY DATE 9/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 7.405 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD 70 BPS     MAKE-WHOLE CALL AT UST 20</p>
<p>							BASIS POINTS</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
